demoted.body:
Hi {name},

the payment for your registration at {tournament} (VS {vs}) did not arrive in time, so you have been moved to the substitute queue:

{moved}

While you wait in the queue you owe nothing — please do not send any payment. If a place opens and the organizer promotes you, we will send payment instructions and a new payment window will open.{credit}

